Guangdong Provincial Education Science Planning Leading Group Office ( 2023GXJK107 ), the Guangdong Planning Office of Philosophy and Social Science ( GD23XGL032 ), the Program for Scientific Research Start-up Funds of Guangdong Ocean University ( 060302092302 ), the Education and Teaching Reform Project of Guangdong Ocean University ( PX-982024013 ), and the Southern Marine Science and Engineering Guangdong Laboratory (Zhuhai) ( SML2020SP002 ). C. Lindemann received funding from the Horizon Europe Framework project C-BLUES (project no. 101137844 ). We are especially grateful to IMECaN, under the IMBeR project, and the ECOP programme, under the UN Ocean Decade, for their valuable support and collaboration."],"id":"S01-000.00-814434","identifier":[{"id":"105011053434","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-4b902776-3dd5-413f-8cf7-5a123624e7ba"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-1931B39A5E712651BA3D0D990D08594E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/787622088/1-s2.0-S2666675825002103-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xinn.2025.101007","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"guangdong ocean university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Guangdong Ocean University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"university of hawai i at mānoa","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Hawai'i at Mānoa","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ca","key":"ioc unesco","loc":["Canada","America, North","OECD"],"name":"IOC-UNESCO","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"jp","key":"japan agency for marine earth science and technology","loc":["Japan","Asia, East","OECD"],"name":"Japan Agency for Marine-Earth Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"au","key":"university of tasmania","loc":["Australia","Ocean