{"abstract":"With rapid advancements in single-cell RNA sequencing (scRNA-seq) technologies, exploration of the systemic coordination of critical physiological processes has entered a new era. Here, we generated a comprehensive Arabidopsis single-nucleus transcriptomic atlas using over 1 million nuclei from 20 tissues encompassing multiple developmental stages. Our analyses identified cell types that have not been characterized in previous single-protoplast studies and revealed cell-type conservation and specificity across different organs. Through time-resolved sampling, we revealed highly coordinated onset and progression of senescence among the major leaf cell types. We originally formulated two molecular indexes to quantify the aging state of leaf cells at single-cell resolution. Additionally, facilitated by weighted gene co-expression network analysis, we identified hundreds of promising hub genes that may integratively regulate leaf senescence. Inspired by the functional validation of identified hub genes, we built a systemic scenario of carbon and nitrogen allocation among different cell types from source leaves to sink organs.","author_count":36,"contributors":["Guo, Xing","Wang, Yichuan","Zhao, Caiyao","Tan, Cong","Yan, Wei","Xiang, Sunhuan","Zhang, Dan","Zhang, Hui","Zhang, Mengting","Yang, Liujing","Yan, Meng","Xie, Pingli","Wang, Yi","Li, Li","Fang, Dongming","Guang, Xuanmin","Shao, Wenwen","Wang, Fang","Wang, Haoxuan","Sahu, Sunil Kumar","Liu, Min","Wei, Tong","Peng, Yang","Qiu, Yuping","Peng, Tao","Zhang, Yi","Ni, Xuemei","Xu, Zhicheng","Lu, Haorong","Li, Zhonghai","Yang, Huanming","Wang, Ertao","Lisby, Michael","Liu, Huan","Guo, Hongwei","Xu, Xun"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-819620"],"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","BGI","Beijing Forestry University","China National GeneBank","Chinese Academy of Sciences","Guangdong Provincial Key Laboratory of Genome Read and Write","Northeast Forestry University","Southern University of Science and Technology","University of Chinese Academy of Sciences","Yunnan University"],"keyword":["Arabidopsis","Leaf senescence","Nutrient allocation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an i arabidopsis i single nucleus atlas decodes leaf senescence and nutrient allocation","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-819620","identifier":[{"id":"40220755","type":"pmid"},{"id":"105005937163","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-8d95bda9-3621-4339-a710-141807aa97a0"],"keyword":["Arabidopsis","cross-organ comparison","leaf senescence","nutrient allocation","single-nucleus atlas"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-61BF4F0205AAB90800F322CE548A57F3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"bgi","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"BGI","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"southern university of science and technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Southern University of Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"northeast forestry university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Northeast Forestry University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"university of chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"cn","key":"yunnan university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Yunnan University","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"cn","key":"china national genebank","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":