Virginia","rank":244,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 192","first":"Hilary","key":"coonhilarypau","last":"Coon","name":"Coon, Hilary","rank":245,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 45","first":"Jean C.","key":"beckhamjeancpau","last":"Beckham","name":"Beckham, Jean C.","rank":246,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 45","first":"Nathan A.","key":"kimbrelnathanapau","last":"Kimbrel","name":"Kimbrel, Nathan A.","rank":247,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","first":"Douglas M.","key":"ruderferdouglasmpau","last":"Ruderfer","name":"Ruderfer, Douglas M.","rank":248,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37777856"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1176/appi.ajp.21121266","issn":["0002953X","11393475"],"issn_org":["0002953X"],"issue":"10","journal":"American Journal of Psychiatry","pages":"723-738","publisher":"Grupo Ars XXI de Comunicacion, SA","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Psychiatry","volume":"180"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85176353814"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Private Research","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Lundbeck Pharma","Miscellaneous","Non-Profit Organisations","Other Research","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-321a664c-f29b-43b3-ac1a-fae88ad60e44","ku-2d1a3b43-8fac-48fc-a5b2-ae7572e7d948"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"GWAS Meta-Analysis of Suicide Attempt : Identification of 12 Genome-Wide Significant Loci and Implication of Genetic Risks for Specific Health Factors","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-088.78-755987","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Advanced oxidation/reduction of PFAS is challenged and concerned by the formation of toxic, short-chain intermediates during water treatments. In this study, we investigated the complete defluorination of PFOA by ultrasound/persulfate (US/PS) with harmless end-products of CO 2, H 2O, and F ‒ ions. We observed 100% defluorination after 4 h of US treatment alone with a power input of 900 W. PS addition, however, suppressed defluorination. We demonstrated by kinetics-fitted Langmuir-type adsorption modeling, the added PS increased competition with PFOA for adsorption sites on the bubble-water interface where radical oxidation and pyrolysis may occur. Providing sulfate (SO 4 •–) and hydroxyl ( •OH) radicals by means other than US did not defluorinate PFOA, indicating that pyrolysis likely contributes to the high defluorination performance. Bond dissociation energies for C[sbnd]C and C[sbnd]F were independent of pressure but decreased at elevated temperatures within cavitation bubbles (i.e., 5000 K) favoring the pyrolysis reactions. Furthermore, bond length calculations indicated that PFOA cleavage only begins to occur at temperatures in excess of those generated at the bubble interface (i.e., >1500 K) at the femtosecond level. This suggests that PFOA vaporizes or injects by nanodrops upon attachment to the cavitation bubble, enters the bubble, and is then cleaved within the bubble by pyrolysis. Our research in low-frequency ultrasonic horn system challenges the previous founding that defluorination of PFOA initiates and occurs at the bubble-water interface. We describe here that supplementing US-based processes with complementary treatments may have undesired effects on the efficacy of US. The mechanistic insights will further promote the implementation of US technology for PFAS treatment in achieving the zero fluoro-pollution goal.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Xiong, Xingaoyuan","Shang, Yanan","Bai, Lu","Luo, Shuang","Seviour, Thomas","Guo, Zheng","Ottosen, Lars Ditlev Mørck","Wei, Zongsu"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-229107"],"filters":{"added":"2023-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Wei, Zongsu"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Hunan Agricultural University","Shandong University"],"keyword":["Fluorocarbons chemistry","PFOA","Persulfate","Pyrolysis","Ultrasonics","Ultrasound"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"complete defluorination of perfluorooctanoic acid pfoa by ultrasonic pyrolysis towards zero fluoro pollution","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2023.119829","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-229107","identifier":[{"id":"85150413017","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36958219","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-aee9b4af-ff17-43d1-a106-78ea0b64c163"],"keyword":["Bond dissociation energy","Caprylates/chemistry","Fluorocarbons/chemistry","Langmuir-type adsorption model","PFOA","Persulfate","Pyrolysis","Ultrasonics","Ultrasound"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6D942D1E20A18C3E90F87B2A88C75B2A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/404581553/1-s2.0-S0043135423002646-main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2023.119829","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering, Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering - Environmental Engineering - Ole Worms Allé 3","Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, WATEC, Centre for Water Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"shandong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shandong University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"hunan agricultural university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Hunan Agricultural University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xingaoyuan","key":"xiongpau","last":"Xiong","locid":"f24e6de1-11e1-41bb-92c9-3238fe7bd754","name":"Xiong, Xingaoyuan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Yanan","key":"shangpau","last":"Shang","name":"Shang, Yanan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lu","key":"baipau","last":"Bai","locid":"98807f94-3f22-46b7-b302-901f47b0b0e4","name":"Bai, Lu","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Shuang","key":"luopau","last":"Luo","locid":"eb56bf19-b0bc-40bf-85bb-255c410aa526","name":"Luo, Shuang","orcid":"0000-0001-8291-2457","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas William","key":"seviourpau","last":"Seviour","locid":"8737bd59-208b-4ff2-8124-d8caad9c7f78","name":"Seviour, Thomas","name_org":"Seviour, Thomas William","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Zheng","key":"guopau","last":"Guo","locid":"67372258-2bc9-4585-98c9-1b93c60d0ca9","name":"Guo, Zheng","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Ditlev Mørck","key":"ottosenpau","last":"Ottosen","locid":"8d9df1ea-6c3b-47a7-960e-c1efcfaac260","name":"Ottosen, Lars Ditlev Mørck","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"coun