1-19d2-4435-b67c-30f991c0dcfa"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Soil conditions and the plant microbiome boost the accumulation of monoterpenes in the fruit of <i>Citrus reticulata</i> ‘Chachi’","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-669216","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Developing an effective deacidification process to utilize high-acid rice bran oil (HRBO) for the production of high-quality and value-added edible products remains challenging. In this study, we developed a novel, multi-purpose, and sustainable lipase-deacidification system for HRBO utilization in glycerol-based deep eutectic solvents (DESs), resulting in a 94.5% deacidification efficiency and simultaneously prevented the glycerolysis side reaction. Importantly, the enzymatic kinetics were investigated in comparison with choline chloride/glycerol DESs and the pure glycerol system. In addition, the underlying mechanism of inhibition accompanied by glycerolysis side reaction in the enzymatic-deacidification of HRBO was proved by molecular docking simulations. We believe our findings demonstrate the potential of glycerol-based DESs as a highly efficient, sustainable, and recyclable solution for the deacidification of edible oils.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Zhou, Pengfei","Liu, Weiqiang","Zhang, Yan","Liu, Guang","Zhao, Zhihao","Zhang, Mingliang","Wei, Zhencheng","Zhang, Yan","Tang, Xiaojun","Li, Ping","Deng, Yuanyuan","Zhang, Mingwei","Guo, Zheng"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-699693"],"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Deng, Yuanyuan","Guo, Zheng","Zhang, Mingwei"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Fujian Normal University","Ministry of Agriculture of the People's Republic of China"],"keyword":["Biocatalysis","Deep eutectic solvents","Glycerol","Rice bran oil"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tuning multi purpose glycerol based deep eutectic solvents for biocatalytic deacidification of high acid rice bran oil kinetics mechanism and inhibition of side glycerolysis","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lwt.2023.115535","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-699693","identifier":[{"id":"85177485746","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-71f57299-0831-446e-b052-7cb5959ae1f5"],"keyword":["Biocatalysis","Deacidification","Deep eutectic solvents","Glycerol","Rice bran oil"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3350EC397BEA434AA0B6781F5E369EDB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lwt.2023.115535","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"ministry of agriculture of the people s republic of china","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Ministry of Agriculture of the People's Republic of China","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering, Department of Biological and Chemical Engineering - Industrial Biotechnology - Gustav Wieds Vej 10D"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"fujian normal university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Fujian Normal University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pengfei","key":"zhoupengfeipau","last":"Zhou","name":"Zhou, Pengfei","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Weiqiang","key":"liuweiqiangpau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Weiqiang","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yan","key":"zhangyanpau","last":"Zhang","locid":"251ea212-fcf4-4249-8672-42fcf09ea051","name":"Zhang, Yan","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},