{"abstract":"Accurately monitoring spatio-temporal changes in lake water levels is important for studying the impacts of climate change on freshwater resources, and for predicting natural hazards. In this study, we applied multi-mission radar satellite altimetry data from the Laurentian Great Lakes, North America to optimally reconstruct multi-decadal lake-wide spatio-temporal changes of water level. We used the results to study physical processes such as teleconnections of El Niño and southern oscillation (ENSO) episodes over approximately the past three-and-a-half decades (1985–2018). First, we assessed three reconstruction methods, namely the standard empirical orthogonal function (EOF), complex EOF (CEOF), and complex independent component analysis (CICA), to model the lake-wide changes of water level. The performance of these techniques was evaluated using in-situ gauge data, after correcting the Glacial Isostatic Adjustment (GIA) process using a contemporary GIA forward model. While altimeter-measured water level was much less affected by GIA, the averaged gauge-measured water level was found to have increased up to 14 cm over the three decades. Our results indicate that the CICA-reconstructed 35-year lake level was more accurate than the other two techniques. The correlation coefficients between the CICA reconstruction and the in situ water-level data were 0.96, 0.99, 0.97, 0.97, and 0.95, for Lake Superior, Lake Michigan, Lake Huron, Lake Erie, and Lake Ontario, respectively; ~7% higher than the original altimetry data. The root mean squares of errors (RMSE) were 6.07 cm, 4.89 cm, 9.27 cm, 7.71 cm, and 9.88 cm, respectively, for each of the lakes, and ~44% less than differencing with the original altimetry data. Furthermore, the CICA results indicated that the water-level changes in the Great Lakes were significantly correlated with ENSO, with correlation coefficients of 0.5–0.8. The lake levels were ~25 cm higher (~30 cm lower) than normal during EI Niño (La Niña) events.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Chen, Wei","Shum, CK","Forootan, Ehsan","Feng, Wei","Zhong, Min","Jia, Yuanyuan","Li, Wenhao","Guo, Junyi","Wang, Changqing","Li, Quanguo","Liang, Lei"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-112560"],"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Feng, Wei"],"country":["China","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese Academy of Sciences","Chuzhou University","Hubei University of Arts and Science","Nanjing Tech University","Ohio State University","Sun Yat-Sen University"],"keyword":["Altimetry","Independent component analysis ICA","Lake","Reconstruction","Satellite altimetry","Statistics","Water level"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"understanding water level changes in the great lakes by an ica based merging of multi mission altimetry measurements","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/rs14205194","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-112560","identifier":[{"id":"85140968177","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d73332ab-5411-4b48-9ace-e201ea55c607"],"keyword":["CICA","Independent component analysis (ICA)","Lake","Reconstruction","Statistics","Water Level","altimetry","lake level changes","satellite altimetry","the Great Lakes","water level stations"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5CE26F21CACE7C3FADEF0FA267E80053"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/rs14205194","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/492071326/remotesensing_14_05194_2_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://mdpi-res.com/d_attachment/remotesensing/remotesensing-14-05194/article_deploy/remotesensing-14-05194.pdf?version=1666013394","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"hubei university of arts and science","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Hubei University of Arts and Science","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"ohio state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Ohio State University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Aalborg University Space Center","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning, Geodesy","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning, Land Management And Geoinformatics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"sun yat sen university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Sun Yat-Sen University","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"cn","key":"nanjing tech university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Nanjing Tech University","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"cn","key":"chuzhou university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chuzhou University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"chenweipau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Wei","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"CK","key":"shumckpau","last":"Shum","name":"Shum, CK","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ehsan","key":"forootanehsanpau","last":"Forootan","locid":"55602064-722d-4aec-b67c-06f498b3ecf2","name":"Forootan, Ehsan","orcid":"0000-0003-3055-041X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"fengweipau","last":"Feng","name":"Feng, Wei","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Min","key":"zhongminpau","last":"Zhong","name":"Zhong, Min","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Yuanyuan","key":"jiayuanyuanpau","last":"Jia","name":"Jia, Yuanyuan","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Wenhao","key":"liwenhaopau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Wenhao","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Junyi","key":"guojunyipau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Junyi","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Changqing","key":"wangchangqingpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Changqing","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Quanguo","key":"liquanguopau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Quanguo","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Lei","key":"liangleipau","last":"Liang","name":"Liang, Lei","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/rs14205194","issn":["20724292"],"issue":"20","journal":"Remote Sensing","paperid":"5194","publisher":"Multidisciplinary Digital Publishing Institute","status":"p","title":"Remote Sensing","volume":"14"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85140968177"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d73332ab-5411-4b48-9ace-e201ea55c607"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Understanding Water Level Changes in the Great Lakes by an ICA-Based Merging of Multi-Mission Altimetry Measurements","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-112560","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"The temporal heterogeneity of nitrogen availability in soils is increasing due to agricultural deposition. We here compared the effects of gradually increasing nitrogen deposition rate and its increasing temporal heterogeneity patterns on the functional traits of seedlings of exotic species Rhus typhina and the native species Rhus chinensis. Nitrogen deposition rates of 0, 8, 20 g N m−2 year−1 and constant, single-peak, and double-peak nitrogen were added to simulate deposition rate and temporal heterogeneity. After 60 days of treatment, R. typhina seedlings had several advantageous growth trait values, such as higher total biomass production, but lower phenotypic plasticity than R. chinensis seedlings. R. typhina seedlings also had higher phenotypic integration, measured as the correlation among functional traits. The increased nitrogen deposition rate affected several traits of the two species differently. Thus, while R. chinensis seedlings allocated more biomass to leaves and less to roots with increasing N deposition, R. typhina seedlings had stable biomass allocation among all N treatments. Chlorophyll content, leaf phosphorus concentration, and water use efficiency increased, but the maximum net photosynthetic rate decreased, with N availability in R. chinensis, but not in R. typhina. Temporal heterogeneity had no significant effect on the total biomass of R. typhina and R. chinensis seedlings. Overall, the performance of R. typhina is better than that of R. chinensis seedlings under different nitrogen deposition treatments, which is due to the significantly advantageous trait values and greater phenotypic integration of R. typhina seedlings, whereas R. chinensis seedlings have higher phenotypic plasticity.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Wang, Qun","Li, Ming Yan","Eller, Franziska","Luo, Yu Jie","Nong, Ying Lan","Xing, Li Jun","Xu, Zhen Wei","Li, Hai Mei","Lu, Hui Cui","Guo, Xiao"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-271003"],"filters":{"added":"2022-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Guo, Xiao"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Qingdao Agricultural University","Shandong University","Shandong Women’s University","Zhejiang Agriculture and Forestry University"],"keyword":["Nitrogen deposition","Phenotypic integration","Phenotypic plasticity","Temporal heterogeneity","Trait value"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"trait value and phenotypic integration contribute to the response of exotic rhus typhina to heterogeneous nitrogen deposition a comparison with native rhus chinensis","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85134255508","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-271003","identifier":[{"id":"35810896","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85134255508","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-f85a7cb2-75ea-4e6d-8e72-c971b0c2745d"],"keyword":["Nitrogen deposition","Phenotypic integration","Phenotypic plasticity","Rhus chinensis","Rhus typhina","Temporal heterogeneity","Trait value"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C976CAF7CCA755574E2532E25C7D7DC5"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"qingdao agricultural university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Qingdao Agricultural University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"zhejiang agriculture and forestry university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Zhejiang Agriculture and Forestry University","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Biology, Department of Biology - Aquatic Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"shandong women s university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shandong Women’s University","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"cn","key":"shandong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shandong University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Qun","key":"wangqunpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Qun","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ming Yan","key":"limingyanpau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Ming Yan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Franziska","key":"ellerfranziskapau","last":"Eller","locid":"15509be6-9a31-4be1-9fab-9bf9db482917","name":"Eller, Franziska","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Yu Jie","key":"luoyujiepau","last":"Luo","name":"Luo, Yu Jie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ying Lan","key":"nongyinglanpau","last":"Nong","name":"Nong, Ying Lan","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Li Jun","key":"xinglijunpau","last":"Xing","name":"Xing, Li Jun","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhen Wei","key":"xuzhenweipau","last":"Xu","name":"Xu, Zhen Wei","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hai Mei","key":"lihaimeipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Hai Mei","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hui Cui","key":"luhuicuipau","last":"Lu","name":"Lu, Hui Cui","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiao","key":"guoxiaopau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Xiao","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["35810896"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.scitotenv.2022.157199","issn":["00489697","18791026"],"issn_org":["00489697"],"journal":"Science of the Total Environment","paperid":"157199","publisher":"Elsevier BV","publisher_org":"Elsevier B.V.","status":"p","title":"Science of the Total Environment","volume":"844"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85134255508"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-f85a7cb2-75ea-4e6d-8e72-c971b0c2745d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Trait value and phenotypic integration contribute to the response of exotic Rhus typhina to heterogeneous nitrogen deposition : A comparison with native Rhus chinensis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-271003","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"The combined anaerobic fermentation of coal and straw can increase the production of biogas. To explore the mechanism of adding corn straw to increase methane production, coal with different metamorphic degrees and corn straw were collected for biogas production simulation experiments under different substrate ratios. The changes in liquid products, the structure of lignocellulose in corn straw, and microbial evolution were monitored. The results showed that the combined fermentation of bituminous coal A with corn straw and bituminous coal C with corn straw at a mass ratio of 2:1 each ((AC-2) and (CC-2)) and that of bituminous coal B and corn straw at a mass ratio of 3:1 (BC-3) had the best gas production, and methane yields reached 17.28, 12.51, and 14.88 mL/g, respectively. The fermentation liquid had organic matter with more types and higher contents during the early and peak stages of gas production, and fewer types of organic matter were detected in the terminal stage. The degradation of lignocelluloses in the corn straw of AC-2 was higher. With the increase in fermentation time, the carbohydrates in the fermentation system increased and the degradation rate of cellulose decreased gradually. The abundance of genes related to nitrate reduction gradually increased, while that of sulfate reduction was on the contrary. Bacteria in the cofermentation system mainly metabolized carbohydrates. During cofermentation with high metamorphic coal, corn straw would be preferentially degraded. The structure of the archaea community changed from Methanosarcina and Methanothrix to Methanobacterium.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Zhang, Wei","Wang, Zebin","Guo, Hongyu","Li, Libo","Zhang, Minglu","Zhang, Wen","Sun, Xiaoguang","Sun, Shixuan","Kou, Congliang","Zhao, Weizhong"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-348451"],"filters":{"added":"2022-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Guo, Hongyu"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","China University of Mining and Technology","Henan Polytechnic University","PetroChina"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"biochemical process and microbial evolution in the conversion of corn straw combined with coal to biogas","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.2c03331","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-348451","identifier":[{"id":"36092578","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC9453931","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"000847918900001","type":"wos"},{"id":"85137303559","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-92f68107-04a7-4500-ab96-4000beed5c95"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-35419EDAC4DBD3BE1702AB1FD4A42E5C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.2c03331","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/284773035/acsomega.2c03331.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"china university of mining and technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"China University of Mining and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"petrochina","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"PetroChina","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"henan polytechnic university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Henan Polytechnic University","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Environmental and Resource Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei","key":"zhangweipau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Wei","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Zebin","key":"wangzebinpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Zebin","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Hongyu","key":"guohongyupau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Hongyu","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Libo","key":"lilibopau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Libo","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Minglu","key":"zhangminglupau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Minglu","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Wen","key":"zhangwenpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Wen","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiaoguang","key":"sunxiaoguangpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Xiaoguang","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Shixuan","key":"sunshixuanpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Shixuan","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Congliang","key":"koucongliangpau","last":"Kou","name":"Kou, Congliang","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Weizhong","key":"zhaoweizhongpau","last":"Zhao","locid":"f578b158-ab0c-40f4-800b-3568f8a45e70","name":"Zhao, Weizhong","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36092578"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/acsomega.2c03331","issn":["24701343"],"issue":"35","journal":"ACS Omega","pages":"31138-31148","publisher":"ACS Publications","status":"p","title":"ACS Omega","volume":"7"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85137303559"],"search"