{"abstract":"Atrial fibrillation (AF) is the most common sustained cardiac arrhythmia and is associated with substantial increases in the risk for stroke and systemic thromboembolism. With the successful introduction of the first non-vitamin K antagonistdirect oral anticoagulant agent (NOAC) in 2009, the role of vitamin K antagonists has been replaced in most clinical settings except in a few conditions for which NOACs are contraindicated. Data for the use of NOACs in different clinical scenarios have been accumulating in the past decade, and a more sophisticated strategy for patients with AF is now warranted. JACC: Asia recently appointed a working group to summarize the most updated information regarding stroke prevention in AF. The aim of this statement is to provide possible treatment options in daily practice. Local availability, cost, and patient comorbidities should also be considered. Final decisions may still need to be individualized and based on clinicians’ discretion. This is part 2 of the statement.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Chiang, Chern En","Chao, Tze Fan","Choi, Eue Keun","Lim, Toon Wei","Krittayaphong, Rungroj","Li, Mingfang","Chen, Minglong","Guo, Yutao","Okumura, Ken","Lip, Gregory Y H"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-101547"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Asia, South","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Chiang, Chern En"],"country":["China","Japan","Singapore","South Korea","Taiwan","Thailand","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","General Hospital of People's Liberation Army","Jiangsu Province Hospital","Liverpool Heart and Chest Hospital NHS Foundation Trust","Mahidol University","Nanjing Medical University","National University Hospital, Singapore","National Yang Ming Chiao Tung University","Saiseikai Kumamoto Hospital","Seoul National University Hospital","Siriraj Hospital","University of Liverpool","Veterans General Hospital-Taipei"],"keyword":["Asia","Atrial fibrillation","NOAC","Stroke","VKA"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"stroke prevention in atrial fibrillation a scientific statement of jacc asia part 000000000002","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jacasi.2022.06.004","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported in part by grants from the Ministry of Health and Welfare (MOHW111-TDU-B-211-134001) and intramural grants from the Taipei Veterans General Hospital (V111C-194). Dr Chiang has received honoraria from AstraZeneca, Boehringer Ingelheim, Daiichi Sankyo, Merck Sharpe & Dohme, Novartis, Pfizer, and Sanofi. Dr Chao has received honoraria for lectures from Boehringer Ingelheim, Bayer, Pfizer, and Daiichi Sankyo. Dr Choi has received research grants or speaker fees from Bayer, Bristol Myers Squibb/Pfizer, Biosense Webster, Daiichi Sankyo, and Medtronic. Dr Krittayaphong has received honoraria from Bayer, Boehringer Ingelheim, Daiichi Sankyo, and Pfizer. Dr Li has received honoraria from Bayer and Boehringer Ingelheim. Dr Chen has received honoraria from Biosense Webster, St. Jude Medical, Medtronic, Bayer, and Boehringer Ingelheim. Dr Okumura has received honoraria from Daiichi Sankyo, Boehringer Ingelheim, Bristol Myers Squibb, Medtronic, Japan Lifeline, and Johnson & Johnson. Dr Lip is a consultant and speaker for Bristol Myers Squibb/Pfizer, Boehringer Ingelheim, and Daiichi Sankyo (no fees are received personally). All other authors have reported that they have no relationships relevant to the contents of this paper to disclose."],"id":"S01-000.00-101547","identifier":[{"id":"36624790","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85139688548","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-b16a1794-f879-4b09-9bb0-33aa2e2b1d4c"],"keyword":["Asia","NOAC","VKA","atrial fibrillation","stroke"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DCF080FF113C5793B0B020DFFBC8E2A3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/493961838/Chiang_et_al._2022_._Stroke_Prevention_in_Atrial_Fibrillation_A_Scientific_Statement_of_JACC_Asia_Part_2_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jacasi.2022.06.004","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"tw","key":"veterans general hospital taipei","loc":["Taiwan","Asia, East"],"name":"Veterans General Hospital-Taipei","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"tw","key":"national yang ming chiao tung university","loc":["Taiwan","Asia, East"],"name":"National Yang Ming Chiao Tung University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"kr","key":"seoul national university hospital","loc":["South Korea","Asia, East","OECD"],"name":"Seoul National University Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"sg","key":"national university hospital singapore","loc":["Singapore","Asia, South"],"name":"National University Hospital, Singapore","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"th","key":"mahidol university","loc":["Thailand","Asia, South"],"name":"Mahidol University","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"th","key":"siriraj hospital","loc":["Thailand","Asia, South"],"name":"Siriraj Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"cn","key":"nanjing medical university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Nanjing Medical University","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"cn","key":"jiangsu province hospital","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Jiangsu Province Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"9","country":"cn","key":"general hospital of people s liberation army","loc":[