{"abstract":"The responses of forests to nitrogen (N) deposition largely depend on the fates of deposited N within the ecosystem. Nitrogen-fixing legume trees widely occur in terrestrial forests, but the fates of deposited N in legume-dominated forests remain unclear, which limit a global evaluation of N deposition impacts and feedbacks on carbon sequestration. Here, we performed the first ecosystem-scale 15N labeling experiment in a typical legume-dominated forest as well as in a nearby non-legume forest to determine the fates of N deposition between two different forest types and to explore their underlying mechanisms. The 15N was sprayed bimonthly for 1 year to the forest floor in control and N addition (50 kg N ha−1 year−1 for 10 years) plots in both forests. We unexpectedly found a strong capacity of the legume forest to retain deposited N, with 75 ± 5% labeled N recovered in plants and soils, which was higher than that in the non-legume forest (56 ± 4%). The higher 15N recovery in legume forest was mainly driven by uptake by the legume trees, in which 15N recovery was approximately 15% more than that in the nearby non-legume trees. This indicates higher N-demand by the legume than non-legume trees. Mineral soil was the major sink for deposited N, with 39 ± 4% and 34 ± 3% labeled N retained in the legume and non-legume forests, respectively. Moreover, N addition did not significantly change the 15N recovery patterns of both forests. Overall, these findings indicate that legume-dominated forests act as a strong sink for deposited N regardless of high soil N availability under long-term atmospheric N deposition, which suggest a necessity to incorporate legume-dominated forests into N-cycling models of Earth systems to improve the understanding and prediction of terrestrial N budgets and the global N deposition effects.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Mao, Jinhua","Mao, Qinggong","Gundersen, Per","Gurmesa, Geshere A.","Zhang, Wei","Huang, Juan","Wang, Senhao","Li, Andi","Wang, Yufang","Guo, Yabing","Liu, Rongzhen","Mo, Jiangming","Zheng, Mianhai"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-395239"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese Academy of Sciences","University of Chinese Academy of Sciences"],"keyword":["N tracer","Nitrogen deposition","Nitrogen retention","Tropical forest"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT"],"level3":{"OT":["Institute of Applied Ecology Chinese Academy of Sciences Shenyang China."]},"level3all":[]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"unexpected high retention of sup 000000000015 sup n labeled nitrogen in a tropical legume forest under long term nitrogen enrichment","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/300764781/ASDA_gcb.16005_1_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-395239","identifier":[{"id":"34800306","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85119984730","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-02f6cde4-788c-4e5f-a5c2-076826c3b407"],"keyword":["N tracer","fate of deposited nitrogen","mature-legume forest","nitrogen deposition","nitrogen-retention","tropical forest"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-56E7909DC9DA280A74630BF14AD573A3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/300764781/ASDA_gcb.16005_1_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Institute of Applied Ecology Chinese Academy of Sciences Shenyang China."],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"university of chinese academy of sciences","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Chinese Academy of Sciences","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Jinhua","key":"maojinhuapau","last":"Mao","locid":"26cc40fb-8381-4a53-ae5a-ebbec705b563","name":"Mao, Jinhua","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Qinggong","key":"maoqinggongpau","last":"Mao","name":"Mao, Qinggong","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Per","key":"gundersenperpau","last":"Gundersen","locid":"0e6a960c-07ea-4a4c-aadd-9fd6d1596244","name":"Gundersen, Per","orcid":"0000-0002-9199-4033","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Geshere A.","key":"gurmesageshereapau","last":"Gurmesa","name":"Gurmesa, Geshere A.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Wei","key":"zhangweipau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Wei","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Juan","key":"huangjuanpau","last":"Huang","name":"Huang, Juan","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Senhao","key":"wangsenhaopau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Senhao","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","first":"Andi","key":"liandipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Andi","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","first":"Yufang","key":"wangyufangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Yufang","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","first":"Yabing","key":"guoyabingpau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Yabing","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","first":"Rongzhen","key":"liurongzhenpau","last":"Liu","name":"Liu, Rongzhen","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jiangming","key":"mojiangmingpau","last":"Mo","name":"Mo, Jiangming","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mianhai","key":"zhengmianhaipau","last":"Zheng","name":"Zheng, Mianhai","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34800306"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/gcb.16005","issn":["13541013","13652486"],"issn_org":["13541013"],"issue":"4","journal":"Global Change Biology","pages":"1529-1543","status":"p","title":"Global Change Biology","volume":"28"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85119984730"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-02f6cde4-788c-4e5f-a5c2-076826c3b407"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Unexpected high retention of <sup>15</sup>N-labeled nitrogen in a tropical legume forest under long-term nitrogen enrichment","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-395239","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"In mammals, the cerebellum plays an important role in movement control. Cellular research reveals that the cerebellum involves a variety of sub-cell types, including Golgi, granule, interneuron, and unipolar brush cells. The functional characteristics of cerebellar cells exhibit considerable differences among diverse mammalian species, reflecting a potential development and evolution of nervous system. In this study, we aimed to recognize the transcriptional differences between human and mouse cerebellum in four cerebellar sub-cell types by using single-cell sequencing data and machine learning methods. A total of 321,387 single-cell sequencing data were used. The 321,387 cells included 4 cell types, i.e., Golgi (5,048, 1.57%), granule (250,307, 77.88%), interneuron (60,526, 18.83%), and unipolar brush (5,506, 1.72%) cells. Our results showed that by using gene expression profiles as features, the optimal classification model could achieve very high even perfect performance for Golgi, granule, interneuron, and unipolar brush cells, respectively, suggesting a remarkable difference between the genomic profiles of human and mouse. Furthermore, a group of related genes and rules contributing to the classification was identified, which might provide helpful information for deepening the understanding of cerebellar cell heterogeneity and evolution.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Li, Zhan Dong","Wang, Deling","Liao, Hui Ping","Zhang, ShiQi","Guo, Wei","Chen, Lei","Lu, Lin","Huang, Tao","Cai, Yu Dong"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-450401"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"country":["China","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Columbia University","Jilin Engineering Normal University","Shandong University of Traditional Chinese Medicine","Shanghai Jiao Tong University","Shanghai Maritime University","Shanghai University","Sun Yat-Sen University","University of Chinese Academy of Sciences"],"keyword":["Cerebellum","Granule cells"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exploring the genomic patterns in human and mouse cerebellums via single cell sequencing and machine learning method","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fgene.2022.857851","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-450401","identifier":[{"id":"85127220098","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC8930846","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"35309141","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-5f2da3f5-9cc8-4da5-b34b-7f84414e604b"],"keyword":["cerebellum","gene expression pattern","golgi cells","granule cells","interneuron cells","machine learning method","unipolar brush cells"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8F2F5F51B41FC5768DC6367CD17D9545"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fgene.2022.857851","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/303957375/Exploring.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"jilin engineering normal university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Jilin Engineering Normal University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"sun yat sen university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Sun Yat-Sen University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"shandong university of traditional chinese medicine","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shandong University of Traditional Chinese Medicine","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ku university of copenh