{"abstract":"A novel three-phase multilevel converter is proposed. The inverter adds a clamping diode between each bridge leg. And using the split inductance method, the inductance is placed between the upper and lower switches of each phase branch. The inverter has a simpler construction and eliminates shoot-through problems without adding dead time. Simulation and experimental results verify that the topology has better voltage and current waveform quality and lower and consistent voltage and current switching stress. Additionally, the topology can be applied to various loads with good response and performance.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Zhang, Shiqi","Wei, Yupeng","Hu, Xiaolei","Guo, Xiaoqiang","Wang, Lichong","Guerrero, Josep M."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-667202"],"event":{"end":"2022-12-12","place":"Beijing, cn","start":"2022-12-09","title":"4th International Conference on Smart Power and Internet Energy Systems, SPIES 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Zhang, Shiqi"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Shenke Electronic Co.","Yanshan University"],"keyword":["Multilevel converter","PS PWM","Shoot through","Three phase inverter"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a novel three phase multilevel converter for medium voltage application","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85153396067&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work was supported in part by the National Natural Science Foundation of China under Grant 52077190, Central for Local Science and Technology Development Program under Grant 226Z4504G, and Hebei Province Natural Science Foundation under Grant F2020203013."],"id":"S01-000.00-667202","identifier":[{"id":"85153396067","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-469d59a8-aebf-40e1-93ad-41839238e7fb"],"keyword":["Multilevel converter","PS-PWM","Three-phase inverter","shoot-through"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E276A2B2EC60FD9E03C81EA772EDBFF4"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"yanshan university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Yanshan University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"shenke electronic co","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Shenke Electronic Co.","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Center for Research on Microgrids​","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Electric Power Systems and Microgrids"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Shiqi","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Shiqi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yupeng","key":"weipau","last":"Wei","name":"Wei, Yupeng","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiaolei","key":"hupau","last":"Hu","name":"Hu, Xiaolei","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiaoqiang","key":"guopau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Xiaoqiang","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lichong","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Lichong","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Josep M.","key":"guerreropau","last":"Guerrero","locid":"07d2eed6-2177-4f61-b812-a08c55b2e8af","name":"Guerrero, Josep M.","orcid":"0000-0001-5236-4592","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/spies55999.2022.10082091","eisbn":["9781665489577"],"isbn":["9781665489560","9781665489584"],"pages":"294-297","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"2022 4th International Conference on Smart Power and Internet Energy Systems, SPIES 2022"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85153396067"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-469d59a8-aebf-40e1-93ad-41839238e7fb"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A Novel Three-Phase Multilevel Converter for Medium Voltage Application","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-667202","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"There are limited studies on the prevalence and incidence of clinically diagnosed hypertrophic myocardiopathy (HCM) and its mortality in the Chinese population, and the projected population burden of HCM over the next decades. We collected data on HCM and its mortality from the Beijing Municipal Health Commission Information Center (BMHCIC) database and estimated the prevalence and incidence based on the whole Beijing population. Calculation of population trends was performed using annual percentage change (APC) and average annual percentage change (AAPC). Finally, future HCM incidence was built by modelling projection of HCM to the next decades using Poisson regression analysis and Gray Model 1,1(GM [1,1]). The prevalence of HCM was 0.0069% (95%CI, 0.0065-0.0072%; N = 1343) in 2010, rising to 0.076% (95% CI, 0.074-0.077%; N = 16,616) in 2019, and the incidence of HCM was 6.85 per 100 000 person-year in 2010, rising to 11.76 per 100 000 person-year in 2019. Males had higher prevalence and incidence of HCM than females. The APPC for the rising incidence of HCM was 5.8% and the expected numbers will double increase in 2029 by assuming the same increase trend as the last decades. HCM had increased annual incidence of HF (APPC: 8.4, 4.4-12.6, p < 0.05), and relatively stable annual incidence of mortality (APPC: 1.2%, - 2.3% to 4.8%, p > 0.05) during the studied period. Males had lower mortality (2.70% vs. 4.20%, p < 0.001) than females. The calculated HCM prevalence was much lower compared to prior screening studies from 2004, although the predicted HCM incidence would double over the next decades. HCM was associated with a stable risk of mortality during the studied period.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Bai, Ying","Zheng, Jian-Peng","Lu, Feng","Zhang, Xi-Lin","Sun, Chang-Ping","Guo, Wei-Hua","Zou, Yi-Xi","Lip, Gregory Y H","Shi, Xu-Bo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-082305"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Bai, Ying","Shi, Xu-Bo"],"country":["China","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Beijing Municipal Health Commission","Beijing Tongren Hospital","Beijing University of Chinese Medicine","Capital Medical University","Liverpool Heart and Chest Hospital NHS Foundation Trust","Tianjin University of Technology","University of Liverpool"],"keyword":["Cardiomyopathy Hypertrophic complications","Cohort Studies","Databases Factual","Female","Humans","Incidence","Male","Prevalence"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"prevalence incidence and mortality of hypertrophic cardiomyopathy based on a population cohort of 000000000021 000000000009 million in china","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-022-20042-9","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-082305","identifier":[{"id":"85141348147","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36335106","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC9637201","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["aau-6eda05f7-34f8-45b8-9151-27bd409a00ce"],"keyword":["Cardiomyopathy, Hypertrophic/complications","Cohort Studies","Databases, Factual","Female","Humans","Incidence","Male","Prevalence"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-275ACC82128723991B9FDC1083BC8B94"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-022-20042-9","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/497209747/Bai_et_al._2022_._Prevalence_incidence_and_mortality_of_hypertrophic_cardiomyopathy_based_on_a_population_cohort_of_21.9_million_in_China.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"capital medical university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Capital Medical University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"beijing tongren hospital","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Beijing Tongren Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"beijing municipal health commission","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Beijing Municipal Health Commission","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"tianjin university of technology","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Tianjin University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"cn","key":"beijing university of chinese medicine","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Beijing University of Chinese Medicine","used":1},{"affno":"6","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Aalborg Thrombosis Research Unit"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"gb","key":"university of liverpool","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Liverpool","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"gb","key":"liverpool heart and chest hospital nhs foundation trust","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Liverpool Heart and Chest Hospital NHS Foundation Trust","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Ying","key":"baipau","last":"Bai","name":"Bai, Ying","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jian-Peng","key":"zhengpau","last":"Zheng","name":"Zheng, Jian-Peng","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Feng","key":"lupau","last":"Lu","name":"Lu, Feng","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Xi-Lin","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Xi-Lin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Chang-Ping","key":"sunpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Chang-Ping","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei-Hua","key":"guopau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Wei-Hua","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Yi-Xi","key":"zoupau","last":"Zou","name":"Zou, Yi-Xi","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6 7 8","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gregory Y. H.","key":"lippau","last":"Lip","locid":"8fa30e84-7381-41b4-8037-afc032238a3d","name":"Lip, Gregory Y H","name_org":"Lip, Gregory Y. H.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Xu-Bo","key":"shipau","last":"Shi","name":"Shi, Xu-Bo","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36335106"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1038/s41598-022-20042-9","issn":["20452322"],"issue":"1","journal":"Scientific Reports","paperid":"18799","publisher":"Nature Publishing Group","status":"p","title":"Scientific Reports","volume":"12"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85141348147"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6eda05f7-34f8-45b8-9151-27bd409a00ce"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Prevalence, incidence and mortality of hypertrophic cardiomyopathy based on a population cohort of 21.9 million in China","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-082305","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"By their paternal transmission, Y-chromosomal haplotypes are sensitive markers of population history and male-mediated introgression. Previous studies identified biallelic single-nucleotide variants in the SRY, ZFY and DDX3Y genes, which in domestic goats identified four major Y-chromosomal haplotypes, Y1A, Y1B, Y2A and Y2B, with a marked geographical partitioning. Here, we extracted goat Y-chromosomal variants from whole-genome sequences of 386 domestic goats (75 breeds) and seven wild goat species, which were generated by the VarGoats goat genome project. Phylogenetic analyses indicated domestic haplogroups corresponding to Y1B, Y2A and Y2B, respectively, whereas Y1A is split into Y1AA and Y1AB. All five haplogroups were detected in 26 ancient DNA samples from southeast Europe or Asia. Haplotypes from present-day bezoars are not shared with domestic goats and are attached to deep nodes of the trees and networks. Haplogroup distributions for 186 domestic breeds indicate ancient paternal population bottlenecks and expansions during migrations into northern Europe, eastern and southern Asia, and Africa south of the Sahara. In addition, sharing of haplogroups indicates male-mediated introgressions, most notably an early gene flow from Asian goats into Madagascar and the crossbreeding that in the 19th century resulted in the popular Boer and Anglo-Nubian breeds. More recent introgressions are those from European goats into the native Korean goat population and from Boer goat into Uganda, Kenya, Tanzania, Malawi and Zimbabwe. This study illustrates the power of the Y-chromosomal variants for reconstructing the history of domestic species with a wide geographical range.","author_count":69,"contributors":["Consortium, Var Goats","Nijman, Isaäc J","Rosen, Benjamin D","Bardou, Philippe","Faraut, Thomas","Cumer, Tristan","Daly, Kevin G","Zheng, Zhuqing","Cai, Yudong","Asadollahpour, Hojjat","Kul, Bengi Çınar","Zhang, Wei-Yi","Guangxin, E","Ayin, A","Baird, Hayley","Bakhtin, Meirat","Bâlteanu, Valentin A","Barfield, Diana","Berger, Beate","Blichfeldt, Thor","Boink, Geert","Bugiwati, Sri R A","Cai, Zexi","Carolan, Sean","Clark, Emily","Cubric-Curik, Vlatka","Dagong, Muhammad I A","Dorji, Tashi","Drew, Louise","Guo, Jiazhong","Hallsson, Jón","Horvat, Simon","Kantanen, Juha","Kawaguchi, Fuki","Kazymbet, Polat","Khayatzadeh, Negar","Kim, Namshin","Shah, Manoj Kumar","Liao, Yuying","Martínez, Amparo","Masangkay, Joseph S","Masaoka, Maho","Mazza, Raffaele","McEwan, John","Milanesi, Marco","Faruque, Md Omar","Nomura, Yuto","Ouchene-Khelifi, Nadjet-Amina","Pereira, Filipe","Sahana, Goutam","Salavati, Mazdak","Sasazaki, Shinji","Da Silva, Anne","Simčič, Mojca","Sölkner, Johann","Sutherland, Alison","Tigchelaar, Johannes","Zhang, Hongpin","Consortium, Econogene","Ajmone-Marsan, Paolo","Bradley, Daniel G","Colli, Licia","Drögemüller, Cord","Jiang, Yu","Lei, Chuzhao","Mannen, Hideyuki","Pompanon, François","Tosser-Klopp, Gwenola","Lenstra, Johannes A"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-179846"],"filters":{"added":"2022-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Africa","America, North","Asia, Central","Asia, East","Asia, Middle East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Lenstra, Johannes A"],"country":["Algeria","Austria","Bangladesh","China","Croatia","Finland","France","Iceland","Indonesia","Ireland","Italy","Japan","Kazakhstan","Nepal","Netherlands","New Zealand","Philippines","Romania","Slovenia","Spain","Switzerland","Turkey","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["AgResearch","Agricultural University of Iceland","All Global Affiliations","Ankara University","Astana Medical University","Bangladesh Agricultural University","Catholic University of the Sacred Heart","International Centre for Integrated Mountain Development Nepal","Kobe University","L'Institut Agro Rennes-Angers","Luke Natural Resources Institute Finland","Sichuan Ag