"first":"Naidong","key":"chennaidongpau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Naidong","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Shaotong","key":"chenshaotongpau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Shaotong","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Xiaoli","key":"lixiaolipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Xiaoli","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Yuan","key":"weiyuanpau","last":"Wei","name":"Wei, Yuan","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Zhen","key":"ouyangzhenpau","last":"Ouyang","name":"Ouyang, Zhen","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Hui","key":"yanhuipau","last":"Yan","name":"Yan, Hui","rank":24,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jiangjie","key":"lujiangjiepau","last":"Lu","name":"Lu, Jiangjie","rank":25,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Huizhong","key":"wanghuizhongpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Huizhong","rank":26,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lanping","key":"guolanpingpau","last":"Guo","name":"Guo, Lanping","rank":27,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lingdong","key":"konglingdongpau","last":"Kong","name":"Kong, Lingdong","rank":28,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jing","key":"zhaojingpau","last":"Zhao","name":"Zhao, Jing","rank":29,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Shaoping","key":"lishaopingpau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Shaoping","rank":30,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lifen","key":"luolifenpau","last":"Luo","name":"Luo, Lifen","rank":31,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Karsten","key":"kristiansenkarstenpau","last":"Kristiansen","locid":"941041b1-1b8f-4be5-9a65-5e98f662c07e","name":"Kristiansen, Karsten","orcid":"0000-0002-6024-0917","rank":32,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Zhan","key":"fengzhanpau","last":"Feng","name":"Feng, Zhan","rank":33,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Silong","key":"sunsilongpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Silong","rank":34,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Cunwu","key":"chencunwupau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Cunwu","rank":35,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Zhen","key":"yuezhenpau","last":"Yue","name":"Yue, Zhen","rank":36,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Naifu","key":"chennaifupau","last":"Chen","name":"Chen, Naifu","rank":37,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["33045048"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/gbe/evaa215","issn":["17596653"],"issue":"12","journal":"Genome Biology and Evolution","pages":"2486-2490","status":"p","title":"Genome Biology and Evolution","volume":"12"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85097570556"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-6ebbb01b-4231-4d0a-a94a-2682e63f8f6d"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Chromosome-Level Genome Assembly of <i>Dendrobium Huoshanense</i> Using Long Reads and Hi-C Data","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-459587","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The temperature distribution on the gas-insulated line (GIL) spacer affects surface charge accumulation. However, the spacer temperature distribution is hard to measure because the conventional electric sensors are large dimensions, hard to multiplex, and sensitive to electromagnetic interference (EMI). In this article, a distributed temperature measurement system of GIL spacer based on the optical frequency domain reflectometry (OFDR) was developed to solve the problems. In this system, ultraweak fiber Bragg grating (FBG) was adopted to replace single-mode fiber due to its higher signal-to-noise ratio. The demodulation method was described for compensating the nonlinear frequency tuning errors induced by the unstable tunable laser. In addition, the relationship between the spacer temperature and the wavelength shift was determined in the calibration experiment. Moreover, the temperature distribution on a 126-kV GIL spacer was measured by the proposed OFDR system. The data processing method for 3-D surface temperature on cone-type spacer was also introduced. High-resolution temperature distribution on the spacer surface was successfully obtained using OFDR system, which is unable to accomplish with the conventional electric temperature sensor.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Ma, Guo Ming","Zhou, Hong Yang","Li, Ya Bo","Zhang, Hanchi","Qin, Wei Qi","Li, Cheng Rong","Yan, Chao"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-786070"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Ma, Guo Ming"],"country":["China","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","North China Electric Power University","Princeton University"],"keyword":["Spacer"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high resolution temperature distribution measurement of gil spacer based on ofdr and ultraweak fbgs","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85085096637&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-786070","identifier":[{"id":"85085096637","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8bbbfd45-df74-44fb-8369-b32c32856afe"],"keyword":["Distribution temperature measurement","gas-insulated line (GIL)","optical frequency domain reflectometry (OFDR)","spacer","surface charge accumulation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B2B28F81099EEFA3E3BFE4D1BFDBE365"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"north china electric power university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"North China Electric Power University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Electric Power Systems","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Electric Power Systems and Microgrids","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"princeton university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Princeton University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Guo Ming","key":"maguomingpau","last":"Ma","name":"Ma, Guo Ming","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hong Yang","key":"zhouhongyangpau","last":"Zhou","name":"Zhou, Hong Yang","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ya Bo","key":"liyabopau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Ya Bo","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Han Chi","key":"zhanghanchipau","last":"Zhang","locid":"ad15f6c4-4e09-427b-b2c6-4105783865f7","name":"Zhang, Hanchi","name_org":"Zhang, Han Chi","orcid":"0000-0001-8834-4841","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wei Qi","key":"qinweiqipau","last":"Qin","name":"Qin, Wei Qi","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Cheng Rong","key":"lichengrongpau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Cheng Rong","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Chao","key":"yanchaopau","last":"Yan","name":"Yan, Chao","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tim.2019.2937408","issn":["00189456"],"issue":"6","journal":"IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","pages":"3866-3873","paperid":"8818371","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement","volume":"69"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8bbbfd45-df74-44fb-8369-b32c32856afe"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"High-Resolution Temperature Distribution Measurement of GIL Spacer Based on OFDR and Ultraweak FBGs","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-786070","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Evidence is mounting that the gut-brain axis plays an important role in mental diseases fueling mechanistic investigations to provide a basis for future targeted interventions. However, shotgun metagenomic data from treatment-naïve patients are scarce hampering comprehensive analyses of the complex interaction between the gut microbiota and the brain. Here we explore the fecal microbiome based on 90 medication-free schizophrenia patients and 81 controls and identify a microbial species classifier distinguishing patients from controls with an area under the receiver operating characteristic curve (AUC) of 0.896, and replicate the microbiome-based disease classifier in 45 patients and 45 controls (AUC = 0.765). Functional potentials associated with schizophrenia include differences in short-chain fatty acids synthesis, tryptophan metabolism, and synthesis/degradation of neurotransmitters. Transplantation of a schizophrenia-enriched bacterium, Streptococcus vestibularis, appear to induces deficits in social behaviors, and alters neurotransmitter levels in peripheral tissues in recipient mice. Our findings provide new leads for further investigations in cohort studies and animal models.","author_count":30,"contributors":["Zhu, Feng","Ju, Yanmei","Wang, Wei","Wang, Qi","Guo, Ruijin","Ma, Qingyan","Sun, Qiang","Fan, Yajuan","Xie, Yuying","Yang, Zai","Jie, Zhuye","Zhao, Binbin","Xiao, Liang","Yang, Lin","Zhang, Tao","Feng, Junqin","Guo, Liyang","He, Xiaoyan","Chen, Yunchun","Chen, Ce","Gao, Chengge","Xu, Xun","Yang, Huanming","Wang, Jian","Dang, Yonghui","Madsen, Lise","Brix, Susanne","Kristiansen, Karsten","Jia, Huijue","Ma, Xiancang"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-035687"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Kristiansen, Karsten"],"country":["China","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","BGI","BGI Group","Michigan State University","The First Affiliated Hospital of Xi’an Jiaotong University","Xi'an Jiaotong University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"metagenome wide association of gut microbiome features for schizophrenia","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-020-15457-9","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-035687","identifier":[{"id":"32235826","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85082791457","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC7109134","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["dtu-866c6efd-3d53-4c58-b479-02622e398006","ku-7d4058fd-8165-4b7e-b042-c85a1475d322"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-A6031E70A9C408576900952EBC0DBFDC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/239955771/Metagenome_wide_association_of_gut_microbiome_features_for_schizophrenia.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/210261067/s41467_020_15457_9.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-020-15457-9","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"the first affiliated hospital of xi an jiaotong university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"The First Affiliated Hospital of Xi’an Jiaotong University","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"cn","key":"bgi group","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"BGI Group","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"cn","key":"bgi","loc":["China","Asia,