er Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85042027943"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-78fa96b8-d3e9-473a-8616-1eff34e3a7db","sdu-a2dccc93-10f0-47f6-b3a1-ed021506fd8c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"A Large-Scale Multi-ancestry Genome-wide Study Accounting for Smoking Behavior Identifies Multiple Significant Loci for Blood Pressure","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.92-043628","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Two-dimensional self-assemblies of four partially fluorinated molecules, 1,4-bis(2,6-difluoropyridin-4-yl)benzene, 4,4′-bis(2,6-difluoropyridin-4-yl)-1,1′-biphenyl, 4,4′-bis(2,6-difluoropyridin-4-yl)-1,1′:4′,1″-terphenyl and 4,4′-bis(2,6-difluoropyridin-3-yl)-1,1′-biphenyl, involving weak intermolecular C[sbnd]H⋯F and C[sbnd]H⋯N hydrogen bonds were systematically investigated on Au(111) with low-temperature scanning tunneling microscopy. The inter-molecular connecting modes and binding sites were closely related to the backbones of the building blocks, i.e., the molecule length determines its binding sites with neighboring molecules in the assemblies while the attaching positions of the N and F atoms dictate its approaching and docking angles. The experimental results demonstrate that multiple weak hydrogen bonds such as C[sbnd]H⋯F and C[sbnd]H⋯N can be efficiently applied to tune the molecular orientations and the self-assembly structures accordingly.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Jin, Xin","Cramer, Jacob Roland","Chen, Qi Wei","Liang, Hai Lin","Shang, Jian","Shao, Xiang","Chen, Wei","Xu, Guo Qin","Gothelf, Kurt Vesterager","Wu, Kai"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-179196"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Asia, South"],"corresponding_author":["Gothelf, Kurt Vesterager"],"country":["China","Singapore"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","National University of Singapore","Peking University","University of Science and Technology of China"],"keyword":["Molecular design","Molecular self assembly","Scanning tunneling microscopy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"pinning down molecules in their self assemblies with multiple weak hydrogen bonds of ch f and ch n","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85007413464","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-179196","identifier":[{"id":"85007413464","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-5770402c-84aa-4ee3-aeca-be561ab1eeff"],"keyword":["Fluorinated pyridyl molecules","Grouped hydrogen bonds","Molecular design","Molecular self-assembly","Scanning tunneling microscopy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-62EC304B58A0FF24B74C9EA25F50FC01"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"peking university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Peking University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Chemistry","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cn","key":"university of science and technology of china","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"University of Science and Technology of China","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"sg","key":"national university of singapore","loc":["Singapore","Asia, South"],"name":"National University of Singapore","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xin","key":"jinxinpau","last":"Jin","name":"Jin, Xin","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","c