{"abstract":"This chapter discusses the new opportunities presented by ionic liquid (IL) properties for chemical and biochemical processes of lipids and mainly focuses on the novel methodologies and opportunities offered by ILs to help solubilize not only hydrophilic but also lipophilic active pharmaceutical ingredients.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Pérez, Bianca","Wei, Wei"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-269975"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Active pharmaceutical ingredient","Bioavailability","Hydrophilic","Hydrophobic","Ionic liquid","Microemulsion","Volatility"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"new opportunities from ionic liquid for chemical and biochemical processes of lipids","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84966737389","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-269975","identifier":[{"id":"84966737389","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-f68e23a6-ea0a-409f-96d3-1df1420e6987"],"keyword":["Active pharmaceutical ingredient","Anticrystal engineering","Bioavailability","Hydrophilic","Hydrophobic","Ionic liquid","Microemulsion","Volatility"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-73D23EEF82AC52E3FFB7167E24960AF3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Engineering, Department of Engineering - Biological and Chemical Engineering, Gustav Wieds Vej"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"p