{"abstract":"The parallel architecture is very popular for power inverters to increase the power level. This paper presents a method for the parallel operation of inverters in an ac-distributed system, to suppress the cross-circulating current based on virtual impedance without current-sharing bus and communication bus. Simulation and experimental results verify the effectiveness of the control method.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Wei, Baoze","Guerrero, Josep M.","Guo, Xiaoqiang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-067939"],"event":{"end":"2015-09-09","place":"Berlin, de","start":"2015-09-06","title":"5th IEEE International Conference on Consumer Electronics (IEEE ICCE-Berlin 2015)","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Yanshan University"],"keyword":["Circulating current","Current sharing","Distributed","Parallel","Virtual impedance"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cross circulating current suppression method for parallel three phase two level inverters","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/236768295/Cross_Circulating_Current_Suppression_Method_for_Parallel_Three_Phase_Tw....pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-067939","identifier":[{"id":"84977638533","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3db777cc-e721-48df-881d-2a0e8746702a"],"keyword":["Circulating current","Current-sharing","Distributed","Parallel","Virtual impedance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F652F78D5265549A67788C5C97070B43"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/236